<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02 · 拆解、撕碎、砸毁与炸掉 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Taking apart, Tearing down & Blowing up</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>22 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>使组件彼此分离用 APART（take apart）；使高耸建筑轰然倒地用 DOWN（tear/knock down）；使物体彻底碎裂成小块用 UP（tear/cut/blow up）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
