<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03 · 打扫、擦拭、整理与丢弃 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Cleaning up, Wiping off & Throwing away</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>33 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>使环境恢复彻底整洁用完结体 UP（clean/tidy up）；使污渍脱离物体表面用 OFF（wipe/wash off）；使垃圾远离自己用 AWAY（throw away）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>away</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>2/7</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [discard] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>throw or cast away</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>discard, fling</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Put</b> <b>away</b> your worries.</div></div></div></td></tr>
